
Book My Show LLD

 - user can browse current movies
 - for each movie user can see user city theatres show times
 - user can select a show and see free seats in show
 - user can select available sheets in a show and proceed to booking
 - a booking for selected seats will be created in CREATED state
 - on booking create we will lock seats
 - for booking user have to make payment
 - for payment success booking will be marked in SUCCESS state
 - on payment failure booking will be marked fail and seats relesed

 Entities

 Theatre
 Screens
 ScreenSeat
 Movie
 Show
 ShowSeat
 User
 Booking
 Payment